This code sets up a Raspberry Pi to read from an MCP3008 ADC connected to a YL-83 rain sensor using SPI. It handles errors, retries on failed SPI transfers, and performs a graceful shutdown on SIGINT. The ADC value is mapped to a rainfall intensity level and logged with a timestamp.

