This code initializes the SPI interface to communicate with the MCP3008 ADC and sets up PWM on a GPIO pin using the `pigpio` library. It reads the ADC value from channel 0, calculates the corresponding PWM duty cycle, and updates the PWM output every 100 milliseconds. The program handles signals to gracefully shut down and release resources.

