This code provides a basic framework for a smart parking gate using a VL53L1X time-of-flight sensor and a servo motor on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It includes error handling for I2C operations, signal handling for graceful shutdown, and logging of gate state changes. The actual distance reading from the VL53L1X sensor is not implemented in this example and should be replaced with the appropriate sensor read function.

