This code sets up a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B to measure distance using an HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensor and control an SG90 servo motor. It uses the pigpio library for GPIO operations and handles interrupts for echo timing. The program logs distance and servo angle to a CSV file, filters distance readings, and handles graceful shutdown on SIGINT.

