This code provides a basic framework for interfacing with the Si7005 sensor on a Raspberry Pi using I2C. It handles errors by closing and reopening the I2C bus and performs a graceful shutdown on SIGINT. The temperature reading is logged every 2 seconds. Adjust the temperature conversion and reading logic as needed based on the Si7005's datasheet.

