This code provides a complete implementation for interfacing with the Sensirion SCD40 CO₂ sensor on a Raspberry Pi Zero W using the libgpiod library for GPIO control and standard I2C operations. It handles initialization, error checking, and resource cleanup, including handling SIGINT to stop periodic measurements cleanly. The program logs the sensor data to a CSV file with timestamps.

