This code sets up a Raspberry Pi Zero W to read differential pressure and temperature from a Sensirion SDP810-500Pa sensor over I2C. It logs the readings to a file and prints warnings if the pressure exceeds 5.0 Pa. The program handles I2C read/write failures, CRC mismatches, and sensor absence robustly. It also cleans up resources on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM.

