This code continuously monitors the air duct pressure using the Sensirion SDP810-500Pa differential pressure sensor on the I2C bus. It triggers a measurement, waits at least 50 ms, reads the 9-byte result, validates the CRC-8, and logs the data to a file. It handles I2C and CRC errors by logging an error message and continuing. It checks the return of every initialization call and exits with an error message if any fails. It handles SIGINT (Ctrl+C) by closing the I2C handle, flushing and closing the log file, and calling the library's cleanup API function before terminating.

