This code provides a basic implementation of a PID-controlled reflow oven using a MAX6675 thermocouple amplifier and a solid-state relay on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It includes error handling for SPI communication and GPIO control, logs temperature readings to a file, and handles termination signals to ensure resources are cleanly released.

