This code provides a complete implementation of a PID-controlled heater regulation system for a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It reads temperature from a PT100 RTD using a MAX31865 over SPI, controls a MOSFET-driven heater using hardware PWM, and implements a PID loop with configurable parameters from a JSON file. The program includes error handling, failsafes, and graceful shutdown on signals.

