This code sets up an adaptive grow light system using a VEML7700 lux sensor and a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It reads the lux value from the sensor, maps it to a PWM duty cycle, and adjusts the brightness of an LED connected to GPIO18. The program logs each measurement to a file and handles signals to shut down gracefully.

