This code continuously monitors three Texas Instruments TMAG5110A1 Hall-Effect latch sensors connected to the Raspberry Pi 4 Model B's GPIO bus. It uses the `libgpiod` library to configure the GPIO pins and read the sensor states. The program logs state changes with an ISO-8601 timestamp to a file named `magnet_log.txt`. It handles sensor read errors gracefully and performs a clean shutdown when receiving a SIGINT or SIGTERM signal.

