This code continuously reads the heading from an HMC5883L magnetometer, applies hard-iron compensation, stores the compensated heading in a circular buffer, and drives GPIO17 high or low based on the deviation from the target heading. It handles I2C errors by logging and retrying, and it cleans up all resources on exit.

