This code initializes the SPI bus and GPIO for the MPU-6050 gyroscope and a warning LED. It reads data from the gyroscope, stores it in a circular buffer, and checks for any axis exceeding ±200 deg/s. If the threshold is crossed, it blinks the LED. On receiving SIGINT, it gracefully shuts down by releasing resources and prints the buffer as CSV.

