This code fulfills the user's request by opening the I2C bus, issuing a zero-length I2C write to generate a start condition, reading two bytes from the Honeywell AWM7300V mass airflow sensor, extracting the 14-bit flow value, converting it to SLPM, and logging the flow rate to a file. It handles errors, retries transient I2C read failures, and installs a SIGINT handler to clean up resources on exit.

